                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A direct sequel to Otherworld: Spring of Shadows\n\nIf you liked the first one, you’ll probably like this entry in the series as well.\nMore colourful characters like Banshees and Gremlins in your continued quest to stop the dark fairy and the winter he will bring. There is a twist you’ll see a mile away which is a bit annoying because your character walks right into it and there is nothing you can do to prevent it.\n\nIt’s a four out of five for me.\n\nCan’t wait for the third part: Otherworld: Shades of Fall",
